  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to enhance the capacities and practices of local government units (LGUs) on circular waste economy in collaboration with private and civil society organizations (CSOs), with focus on youth and gender equality. Key results expected at the end of the Project include:&#x2022;	Reduced volume of waste generated and sent to landfills in partner LGUs &#x2022;	Greenhouse gas emissions reduced and avoided (tonnes of CO2eq) from reduced waste and implementation of circular economy initiatives&#x2022;	At leas</narrative>
  </description>
